      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">About the Feature</span></p><p>Users will be able to create and edit services and specialities offered at their hospital/clinic. </p><p><em><strong>Service </strong></em></p><p><span>A service is that entity which is offered to a patient by a care provider. Users are expected to select a service when scheduling their appointment.</span><span>Eg: Chemotherapy, X-ray, Dental, Diabetic Clinic, Dialysis, Nutritional Counseling  etc</span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><em><strong>Speciality </strong></em></p><p>Speciality is a branch of medicine as being provided by a hospital. E.g Cardiology, Oncology, Orthopaedics, Endocrinology etc. It could also be referred to as various departments in a hospital.Under the umbrella of a speciality, multiple services will be offered to the patients. </p><h2 id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-UsedBy\">Used By</h2><p>Typically creating/updating services and specialities are Admin activities. The person with appropriate privileges will be allowed to Add or edit services. You can find more details on roles and privileges <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/144801828/User+Roles+and+Privileges+for+Appointment+Scheduling\" data-linked-resource-id=\"144801828\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a>.</p><p>There is a UI for adding and editing services, which is described below. For specialities, the implementers are expected to run a script as described <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953304/Set+up+Services+Specialities\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a> to create specialities in a hospital/clinic. </p><h2 id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-Howisitused?\">How is it used?</h2><p><span>Click on the Appointment Scheduling App on the Home page. </span><span>Under the Admin tab of the app, the user will be able to define and edit services.</span></p><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"103\" width=\"929\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Admin-Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134202466&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=102\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/Admin-Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134202466&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"140640332\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Admin-Tab.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"60f2b090-94f8-4bb6-98c1-30945858c068\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Admin-Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134202466&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1439&amp;height=159 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Admin-Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134202466&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=102 1x\"></span></span></p><h3 style=\"display: inline;\" id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-AddinganewService\"><strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Adding a new Service<br/></strong></h3>1. Click on the &quot;Add new Service&quot; button on the screen to access the Services Screen <p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" height=\"400\" width=\"824\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Add%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134494553&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=824&amp;height=399\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/Add%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134494553&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"140542002\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Add service.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"eb1d68d7-299a-4ae8-9071-9d7b2c00eb49\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Add%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134494553&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1436&amp;height=697 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/Add%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505134494553&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=824&amp;height=399 1x\"></span></p><p>2. The User would be required to provide the following details to create a new service:</p><ol><ol><li><p><strong>Name</strong>: Unique name for the service. Mandatory field. </p></li><li><p><strong>Description</strong>: Describe the service</p></li><li><p><strong>Duration of service</strong>: Consultation time required to offer the service to a patient.</p></li><li><p><strong>Start Time &amp; end time</strong>: The working hours for a service or availability of a service</p><ul><li><p>For example, if the diabetes clinic operates from 9.00 AM to 11.00 AM, then start time would be 9.00 AM and end time would be 11.00 AM</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Max Load:</strong> This is the indicative maximum no. of appointments that can be booked for a service, for a given availability (start and end time mentioned above)</p><ul><li><p>For example, the clinic can take a maximum of 10 patients between 9.00 AM - 11.00 AM  </p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Location</strong>: A default location where a service is expected to be offered to the patients. </p><ul><li><p>For example, OPD1 </p></li><li><p>All locations marked as &quot;appointment locations&quot; in openMRS will be available in the dropdown to choose from.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Speciality</strong>: A service will be associated with a broader speciality.</p><ul><li><p>For example, X-Ray as a service under Radiology.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Label Colour: </strong>The services can be assigned colours. On the calendar view, all the appointments booked for this service, will be displayed in this chosen colour.</p><ul><li><p>This is available to users only when calendar view is turned on. Learn more it <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953307/Configure+Views+of+Appointments\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953307\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953304/Set+up+Services+Specialities\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a>.<strong><br/></strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Service Appointment Type:</strong></p><ul><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Service appointment types are the further granular categories under a service. One service may have different types of appointment types under a service <br/>For example,  Initial assessments, Follow-Up Consultations, Nutrition counseling, General Consultation etc under Diabetic service. <br/>Different types of scans under Ultrasound as a service etc Eg: Anomaly Scan(1 hr), Viability Scan(15 min) and Growth Scan(1 hr)</li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">Duration: Each of these types are associated with a particular duration. This will override the duration mentioned in Point c above.</p></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">Service Appointment types can also be deleted, by clicking on the cross button beside the Service appt. type.  </p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e076a01c-c11a-4dbf-889e-2ffb2136a762\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Info</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The ability to have service appointment types will be a configuration. You can find more information <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953304/Set+up+Services+Specialities\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a>.</p></div></div></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"> <strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Service Availability</strong> :<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">One can either mention a global availability for a service as mentioned in point d above or could specify a more granular availability.</li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">By Default, a service is available on all days of the week at all times, if no availability is defined. Multiple availabilities can be tied to one service.</li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Example of service availability:<br/><ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">A diabetes clinic in a Hospital is available on Monday and Friday from 10 - 5 pm and on Wednesday from 2-5 pm.<br/>Then the user will have 2 availabilities defined:<br/>For Monday &amp; Friday ; with a start and end time of 10am and 5pm<br/>For Wednesday; with a start and end time of 2pm and 5pm</li></ol></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Each availability of a service will have the following attributes:<ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Days of the week : Monday to Sunday. Configuration to select the start of the week can be found <em><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953304/Set+up+Services+Specialities\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a></em>. </li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Start time and end Time : The start and the end time will decide the time ranges that will be available to the user for booking appointments. </li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Max load for that availability (day) : <br/><ol><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">The max number of patients that can be scheduled for a service for a defined duration in the day i.e limit to the no.of appointments that can be booked. This will override the value in point e mentioned above. </li><li style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">This value will be displayed to the user when they are booking an appointment for the service.</li></ol></li></ol></li></ol></li></ol></ol><p>The screenshot below shows the Service availabilities and the Service Appointment Types defined: </p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" alt=\"Service Availability and Service Appt. types\" height=\"400\" width=\"798\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/availability%2BSub%20types.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505731527766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=798&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/availability%2BSub%20types.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505731527766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143229003\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"availability+Sub types.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"831cb277-902f-4ef4-8e6e-b05b5b9c5c95\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Service Availability and Service Appt. types\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/availability%2BSub%20types.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505731527766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1440&amp;height=722 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/availability%2BSub%20types.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505731527766&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=798&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">After a successful save, the user will be able to see the newly added service in the list of services screen.</p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"232\" width=\"929\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/List%20of%20services.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505732986141&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=231\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/List%20of%20services.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505732986141&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143327257\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"List of services.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"aa42fabe-a882-4179-9767-88b8b0cf33d7\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/List%20of%20services.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505732986141&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1440&amp;height=359 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/List%20of%20services.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505732986141&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=231 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-EditingaService\"><strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">Editing a Service</strong></h3><ol><li>Click on the Edit link to edit a service</li></ol><p><strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"225\" width=\"899\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-6-4.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734567879&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-6-4.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734567879&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143327276\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-9-18_17-6-4.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"f86a9037-2481-4600-a7c9-d04e54571c82\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-6-4.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734567879&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-6-4.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734567879&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225 1x\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\">2<strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">. </strong>Do the necessary edits and &quot;Save&quot; the Service</p><p><strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"400\" width=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/edit%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734522454&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=900&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/edit%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734522454&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143327271\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"edit service.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"64e5db21-40fa-48c0-9503-4fd16d88a645\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/edit%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734522454&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1440&amp;height=640 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/edit%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734522454&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=900&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\">3. Confirm the Edit: Editing the service will require the user to confirm the edits, as editing a service might affect the existing appointments</p><p><strong style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"201\" width=\"929\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/confirm%20edit.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505735382743&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=200\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/confirm%20edit.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505735382743&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143392832\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"confirm edit.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"0a776f50-4a3b-4afa-abc6-b5c9796bf9d5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/confirm%20edit.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505735382743&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1440&amp;height=311 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/confirm%20edit.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505735382743&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=200 1x\"></span></strong></p><h3 id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-DeletingaService\"><strong>Deleting a Service</strong></h3><ol><li>Click on the Edit link to delete a service</li></ol><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"225\" width=\"899\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-3-36.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734420589&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-3-36.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734420589&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143392821\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-9-18_17-3-36.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"46c79ff2-b7b5-4a55-b3d1-3b6ab471cbd6\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-3-36.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734420589&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/138280979/image2017-9-18_17-3-36.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734420589&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=899&amp;height=225 1x\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\">2. Confirm the delete </p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/delete%20a%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734396789&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/138280979/delete%20a%20service.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1505734396789&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"143392816\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"delete a service.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"138280979\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"b0831c46-2c91-4957-bab2-4f42a8b9abac\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span></strong></p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"627c6a65-c8bc-4ed1-ad7e-4834a2fe333d\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>A service or a service appointment type cannot be deleted if there are scheduled future appointments. The user will be asked to cancel/reschedule such appointments before deleting the service or service appointment type.  </p></div></div><h3 id=\"Services&amp;Specialities-AddingSpecialities\">Adding Specialities</h3><p>There is no UI to add Speciality. Also implementations can choose to not have specialities. Click <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/137953304/Set+up+Services+Specialities\" data-linked-resource-id=\"137953304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">here</a> to know how to configure a speciality. </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/></p><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f512f0ca-55cd-4178-89ec-abd27c669728\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>On this Page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"0237b716-410c-41c5-8b04-61738e88407b\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
